# Why: with docs mixed in, natural-language queries get pulled toward the docs. In practice, asking for
# "the path that uploads a beacon set to Firebase" returned
# PROGRESS.md and .planning/** as the top results and pushed the code nodes down.
# Docs can be found with grep, but code call relationships are visible only in the graph.

